    "exact_equities": "Hero equity vs QTs is ~80.4% (Villain ~19.2%), vs QJs is ~80.7% (Villain ~18.9%), vs Q9s is ~82.1% (Villain ~17.5%). QT relatively minimizes Hero's equity the most."
  },
