    "camp_a_heuristic_blindspot": "Camp A claims that on broadway runouts QJ retains 'the superior kicker when the queen later pairs.' This is nonsense: on a board like K-T-Q-x-x, AA doesn't care about a Jack kicker; if Villain has QJ, they have two pair, just as QT has two pair on K-J-Q-x-x. Kicker rank never breaks a tie against an overpair.",
